    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Non-self' is just that principle of cause and effect."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2210 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2211,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2212,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_320 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "CAUSES AND CONDITIONS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "78e9719481c91d73644f91c74d46fc37"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "For example, somebody may have a very hot temper, and that person's conditioning includes certain triggers that sets off their temper."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2213 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_1218,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2214,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2215,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2216,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2217,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_320 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "CAUSES AND CONDITIONS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "14edd0a7b74ead10a8bd83081e14169c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "If you understand that a person's past conditioning is what is causing them to lose their temper as opposed to believing that they personally have negative intentions towards you, then it becomes easier to see the process and forgive that person."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2218 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_1202,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2196,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_460 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "CAUSES AND CONDITIONS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1b30382e992bda21cc4025693a95cf0c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 2 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "You recognize that because of conditions, the results arise, and it's not the person who's angry, but a set of conditions that has brought about this effect."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2219 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2220,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_897 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "CAUSES AND CONDITIONS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "15f8e02176f2d3a0262b2d33bc7de342"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "If you stay in the present moment, moment to moment to moment, you see the principles unfold."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_222 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_137,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_223,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_36,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_55 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Dear Reader"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f3ce91c5da24c1da9fa416bd381d65a7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Finally, this book is by no means comprehensive, and not meant to replace Sayadaw's personal guidance or your own further exploration of the Dhamma."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2221 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_1310,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_18 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "CAUSES AND CONDITIONS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a8f25d3f8283407aa93390feb6c51d62"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "If you are angry and you watch that anger many times, you will begin to notice how the anger cannot run away with you as long as you are aware."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2222 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_18,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2223,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_301,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_311 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "CAUSES AND CONDITIONS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "16451fda68d437263105be7c4a324ce4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "You begin to see how, with awareness + wisdom, the unwholesome mental states cannot take over the mind."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2224 a neo:Document ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "CAUSES AND CONDITIONS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f6c1e25c9d7ea98e8323855d9f39adfd"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Without awareness + wisdom, the unwholesome mental states can gain momentum unbeknownst to you."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2225 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_113,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2226,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2227,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_237 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "CAUSES AND CONDITIONS"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "afd18d8ca9b48d1810623b172204f675"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "When there is knowing, you begin to notice how the habit of anger could arise in the absence of awareness or wisdom and how the process unfolds naturally."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2228 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2229,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2230,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2231 ;
