    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "and I say, \"Know that you are speaking, notice whatever part of the speaking experience is most obvious to you.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2325 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2326,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_311,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_75 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7dd95df6851e96347c5b345d89a1ff60"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "On retreat we practice observing body sensations and feelings, and observing the mind."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2327 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_120,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_1777,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_681 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "da767ced061d56e87c8968042c6b10a6"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "All these things are still present when we speak and we want to know which of these catches our attention as we speak."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2328 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2329,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2330 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f993657b6049f8ccb63f46504fe266f8"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 6 ;
    neo:text "The biggest trap when speaking is the strong desire to speak, wanting a lot to speak."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2331 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_131,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_144,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2332 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "bdf2bf5fbe8fbc26b035efafad9233f2"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 7 ;
    neo:text "A strong desire to speak is greed and mindfulness then goes out the window."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2333 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2334,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2335 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0706622fc589a45b2a757d7f326e671e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "We can't practice awareness of speech alone; we have to speak to somebody."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2336 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2337,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2338,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2339,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2340,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2341,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2342 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "43dc5a96231e55148088fb81f5636e42"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "We have to pay attention to an outside object, not just our own mind and body, so we lose mindfulness because our attention goes fully outside and then we are no longer attentive internally or to our speech."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2344 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2345,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_348 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6101d5593546c3d0d3a614b408a01433"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "We start to think about the other person and look at the other person and then all our attention and our awareness goes outwards and our attention is no longer also directed toward ourselves."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2347 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2348,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2349 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "165273cf771af5ed567dd29185407b8a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 5 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "On the other hand, practicing talking meditation too formally and only in paying attention to one self will make the conversation stiff and unnatural."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_235 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_236,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_237 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "On Language"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c20d1a98da82a41d2a4466ac9da1224d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "A construct like \"the mind is knowing\" instead of \"the mind knows\" is used in instances where it seems more appropriate to describe something in process."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2350 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_131,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2275,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2351,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2352,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_245 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f6fcbfb1bd14628554125ea3aa0031e5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A yogi said in a Finnish retreat that while the retreat is quite good for mindfulness, there's a lot of stuff happening and especially in speaking."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2353 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2354,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2355,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2356,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_245 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5bcc88afad84cbf73961888ffb11b2fe"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "When speaking with others, a yogi has to be responsive and quick and it feels like they're doing two jobs at once."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2357 a neo:Document ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6245d87865b0713bf93aa698a73ff0dc"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Yes--it will be this way."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2358 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_1217,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2359 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "345106f0929dc7b0663cb0ef9e59cd3f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "It's all about skill, and skill is gained from continued practice."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2360 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_120,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2361 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0ffa12d850394adaebeadbd93ab50118"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "We will be slow in any subject when we are not skillful as yet."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2362 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_1304,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_237,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_966 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d14a7917accd31db662254821b8c4e1a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:sentence_number 6 ;
    neo:text "As we do it over and over again, we gain momentum and the process becomes easier."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2363 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2364,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2365,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_966 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "134c55e1cbb21d3bfabec13e31ff3368"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:sentence_number 7 ;
    neo:text "While there may be a lot of personal effort in the beginning, it eventually begins to roll on its own momentum, like riding a bike."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2366 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2367,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2368,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2369 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e438586471be57aba5ba14e7469dc27b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:sentence_number 8 ;
    neo:text "I liken it to martial arts, where at first you are practicing some simple moves and after a while (you don't know when), you can just use them automatically."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2370 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2371,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2372,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_311,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_47 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e1996bd278de2f35fe34cf48876218ae"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 6 ;
    neo:sentence_number 9 ;
    neo:text "In this same way, the mind may now be a little slow and deliberate when it begins this practice, but as you keep doing it, you will find it slowly becoming automatic."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2373 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2374,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2375 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Day-to-Day"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "SPEAKING MINDFULLY"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5b3c5962f86b039c14097dd60feeac8f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 7 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "You could try practicing in this way: Know what you want to say."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2376 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2102,
