    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 18 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "The mind arises in the present moment and passes away in the present moment."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3417 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_120,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_311,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3418,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3419 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "26bc3fce27543e5b54665992df5a83f4"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 18 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Thoughts about home or work arise in the mind and we can acknowledge these thoughts arising each time it happens."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_342 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_337,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_343,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_344,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_345,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e9a88f7127bfcfc2b602cd6a2f2df2a3"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 6 ;
    neo:text "He also told me something that really stuck with me: be happy when I noticed anything about myself because it meant that I was aware of myself, that I was mindful."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3420 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_1539,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2623,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_311,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_897 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7801ec830786adc209b7a0972598914e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 18 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Actually the mind does not wander anywhere nor does it go anywhere; it thinks about the past and future in the present moment."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3422 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_15,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_448 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7a492174aa11ef684c995499f5efdd37"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 19 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "You can relate to pain in the same way."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3423 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3424,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_448 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "e2475c15cd1f9769d3b147c83c350f35"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 19 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "When you notice even a little bit of pain, first check your attitude."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3425 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_145,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_295,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_311,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3424,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3426,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_92 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "327aaa9404e1a806ed940416b8265767"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 19 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "If the mind is feeling uncomfortable, adjust the attitude, remind yourself that this is nature and then, having brought in the right view, watch the discomfort or the aversion in the mind."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3427 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2407,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3428 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7981154a3dc60a6c7b76dc729c1ab90e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 19 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "First, watch the resistance and then you can watch the actual physical sensations."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3429 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3430,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_448 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ff139da7c7ee40da36f0091bc7ae7cb7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 19 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "To begin with, why do you observe pain?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3431 a neo:Document ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "704a0cbf00118f4a9dad6f39264318ae"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 19 ;
    neo:sentence_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Do you want to make it go away?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3432 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_1130,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_1928,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3433 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9a821925b06184c51031bc909df51cdc"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 19 ;
    neo:sentence_number 7 ;
    neo:text "It is natural for the body to become uncomfortable if we sit still for long periods."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3434 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_1218,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3435,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_448 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ff730b8c047fc00e9705f44a7b37ab5b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 19 ;
    neo:sentence_number 8 ;
    neo:text "We should observe pain because we want to understand something about the nature of pain; we don't observe pain in hopes that it will go away."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3436 a neo:Document ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0f5cd78cd463293a2333831a80cf3a8c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 19 ;
    neo:sentence_number 9 ;
    neo:text "Why do you think your leg hurts when it hurts?"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3437 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3438,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3439 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b14171cbdd0b20de9bd4b7413b4da781"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 19 ;
    neo:sentence_number 10 ;
    neo:text "The simplest answer is that your leg hurts because you have a leg."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3440 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_1130,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3441 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "10c04f76b544594be6c9009dc9455f04"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 19 ;
    neo:sentence_number 11 ;
    neo:text "Where there is a body, there will also be physical pain."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3442 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_18,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_92 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Appendix: Mindfulness in Brief"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f3508e8d91af802521e08786e294be51"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 19 ;
    neo:sentence_number 12 ;
    neo:text "That is awareness and right view that we can develop."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3443 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_2687,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_3444 ;
