    neo:sentence_number 12 ;
    neo:text "Never mind if I couldn't have that bliss back, I thought."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_452 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_327,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_423,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_432 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "afa29578b775982f2fa2c762f924a4b6"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:sentence_number 13 ;
    neo:text "I just dropped it and continued to meditate without any more desire to achieve that bliss."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_453 a neo:Document ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a8f7c0912ddf745d9bfb587f5615b956"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:sentence_number 14 ;
    neo:text "It came back, just like that."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_454 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_320,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_423 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "7ac2f42393c60cbf7658c43ad0941e6f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:sentence_number 15 ;
    neo:text "As I simply paid attention to what I was doing, without a thought of having any more of the bliss, it was back."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_455 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_26,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_320,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_414,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_456,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_64 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d972f798c84d332e602620ce1bac9280"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 8 ;
    neo:sentence_number 16 ;
    neo:text "And I learned this huge lesson about meditation, which has stayed with me ever since, and I ran all the way to my teacher's kuti (cottage) to tell him and he hammered home the bitter lesson, saying, \"Well if you can get it by doing it, then do it.\""^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_458 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_144,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_26,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_311,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "87e7852388bbd54bc37a5a9934fbc966"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "I didn't know the mind directly then, but I just realized very deeply that greed was neither useful nor helpful when practicing meditation."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_459 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_432,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_460 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0a1e18c788e0e56e4ecab8843c7d5148"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "It had no place in getting me results."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_461 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_144,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_26,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_320 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4c8ae7068841c91dde0f85a8932ed354"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "So I never had greed when I meditated anymore."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_462 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_144,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_338,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_463 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9dc7ac1eb014eb798903fb042d4afb4e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 9 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Ironically that did not prevent me from having greed in many other aspects of my life, so much so that it led to depression."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_464 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_335,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_465,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_49,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_75 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b35a199356fc3fa2f2f2e7dc1b033914"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "When I was around 18 to 20 years old on one of my retreats with my teacher, I remember Sayadawgyi mentioning that we can ask what the mind is aware of."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_466 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_131,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_467,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_468,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_49,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_79 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "be249bfa0218fe23429472073b6e2979"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Until then, in all my retreats over the years, although I was totally dedicated to being mindful on retreat, I simply watched my body movements and sensations."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_469 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_306,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_470,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_471 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "faea7822a77fbe94daddb102fb5da5a7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "When thoughts were noticed, I acknowledged them then returned to the task of being aware of all my bodily movements and sensations, over and over again all day long."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_472 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_320,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_360,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_473,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_474,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_475,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_64 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "313fb971789876f7a883dcf40b86f264"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "I recalled my teacher's words the next morning as I was brushing my teeth and when I posed the question, it felt like a weight was suddenly taken off my mind."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_476 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_47,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_477,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_478,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_479,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_75 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "62d4788d9e02cca9731fb58bb06e3370"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 10 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "As it was, my practice had built up quite a bit of momentum on the retreat so when the attention turned to what the mind was aware of, and what the mind knew, there was suddenly so much to know!"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_48 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_45,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_49,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_50 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Acknowledgements"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "9d0012ffd2e996ff9cd3777ab5e64012"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Finally, I would like to thank everyone who has contributed to the completion of this book."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_480 a neo:Document ;
