    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "50eb88e9012831ba2adde9adccf6e536"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "At home, the practice was forgotten and I got busy having fun with my friends."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_497 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_498,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_499 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "5ad0a8ce11c7701f6ced05ff6776ec75"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "At University to study engineering, I became so involved in having so much fun with my friends that I flunked my second year of Regional College."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_5 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_6,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_7 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Introduction (ghost chapter)"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "560b6566ef6eb784febb083aa1cefdb0"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 3 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Edited by Laura Zan Namo Tassa Bhagavato Arahato Samma-Sambuddhassa"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_500 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_495,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_501,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_502,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_503,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_504,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_505,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_506 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1f29300f717aa2f13df18205b594d93e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "At about this time, my oldest brother passed away from leukemia at the age of 43, and my father needed help running his menswear shop in a bustling wholesale center in downtown Yangon, a walking distance from our home."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_507 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_338,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_503,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_508,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_509,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_510,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_511,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_512 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "284947fc92dd236d037606051f996a4e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "My father decided to take me out of University, no doubt a fact that I was a non-doctor in a family filled with brothers and a sister studying medicine."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_51 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_52,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_53 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Dear Reader"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "990cefa55896497b23ed38ce19672c26"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "It doesn't take long for a yogi (meditator) new to Sayadaw U Tejaniya to notice humor permeating his teachings."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_513 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_514,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_515,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_516 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fb59c7ad619c4e3cd01668561306dc58"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 11 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "The only other brother not studying medicine had already finished University and was helping my father with the shop."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_517 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_498,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_518,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_519 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1c6f84b06a733cde25bca73476cff7a5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "I wanted so much to continue to be with my friends that I actually, while helping out at the shop, still tried to repeat my second year at University on my own."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_520 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_49,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_496,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_499,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_521 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "fe1b5858c47b8c3bb8a9386d6d66083a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "It was not as much fun anymore by then because all my friends had already moved on to the main Rangoon University for their third year in Engineering studies while I was still at the Regional College."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_522 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_523 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8b203ac5c31d47b003abbc6fd2310e2d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "It was discouraging, so I stopped trying to repeat the year."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_524 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_463,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_525,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_526,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_527,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_528,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_529 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "c3b7ca0ea196b8ceb41e0917c94add89"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "I slowly descended into depression from resentment, fear, dissatisfaction, having to do what I did not want to, and not being able to do what I wanted to do."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_530 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_320,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_531,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_532 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "dd0c59bfa8697fddb5287cc71af8eff9"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 12 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "It was the love, or actually greed for fun that indirectly led to my years of depression."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_533 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_463,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_534 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3bfeb4d52d43f0a155c0781659ecfbea"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 13 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Initially I forgot about my unhappiness after a while, because it wasn't very strong then and the depression seemed to go away."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_535 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_536 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "96aedf9d70f762a653749c7bd8979af7"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 13 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "When it returned a second time, I got fed up of feeling mopey and angrily railed against the emotion and willed myself to overcome it that way."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_537 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_49,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_515,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_538,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_539,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_64 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "31b82c722dd5f5587a5094179bbe3269"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 14 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "While I was working with my father, I got more of an opportunity to go for longer retreats at my teacher's monastery too, than when I had been in school."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_54 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_55,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_56 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Dear Reader"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "48499a352994b835c7b7160924e6342c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 1 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Whether it is making an observation on his surroundings or commenting on the environment of the mind, Sayadaw, or \"the Teacher\" as his disciples fondly call him, delivers his teachings with a good dose of wit."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_540 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_503,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_541,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_542 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2c4db8d4004e6b4d177d3743ef74166f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 14 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "My father had no objections to my going and I mostly did the customary days off during the Burmese New Year."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_543 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_320,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_509 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "93954f00d99058d152cf79933d5abad5"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 14 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "At one point I thought I wanted to be a monk for life and told my family and my teacher and they were all happy for me."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_544 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_545,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_546 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0756bc6aedd4602d0f810e2202101e73"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 14 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "Ten months in, my mind had changed again, and I just could not stay at the center any longer."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_547 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_338,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_64 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b2ff29f60345d5952f54e0437dc2abc3"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 14 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "My teacher gently tried to persuade me to stay but when my mind was made up there was no changing it."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_548 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
