    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 20 ;
    neo:sentence_number 7 ;
    neo:text "The Vicks inhaler is a small tube with some mentholated ointment or oil inside that one can inhale through the tube."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_723 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_724,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_725,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_726,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_727 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2f978ba19d0ef41b6f14b099409b993f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 20 ;
    neo:sentence_number 8 ;
    neo:text "The sensation in the nose when I inhaled it would help to bring the mind's attention back, and if I was really desperate I would inhale sharply to get a really strong sharp sensation that would get the mind's attention, helping to gain control over getting mentally overwhelmed."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_728 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_729,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_730 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "4f483bfaf1940acceceb8ab560895cb3"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 21 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "During these initial two months I also began reading the books of Mogok Sayadaw."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_73 a neo:Document ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Dear Reader"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "2a19805b1a772339ba213f849087ec0e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Sayadaw often encourages yogis to continue cultivating their own energy and wisdom after a retreat."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_731 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_137,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_732,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_733,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_734 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "a4a18f43bfa47ccbfe89d9dd72632086"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 21 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "I happened to see my friend with one of a series of 36 books on Mogok Sayadaw's teachings and eventually borrowed about six books over some months."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_735 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_729,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_736 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "827fe61267fb959f7d1c5f6fbf455c75"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 21 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Reading a few pages of these books every night, I eventually realized that Mogok Sayadaw was pointing to check to see how the mind is reacting to whatever it is knowing, over and over, constantly."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_737 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_738,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_739,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_740,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_741 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "76e6cdad8f181d541f4b2f357d2df38c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 22 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "About two months after I began trying to practice at home and at work, the mind did begin to gain some balance."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_74 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_55,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_75,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_76,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_77 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Dear Reader"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "909a9e78602e396dd1a0431267b49311"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "To help post-retreat, some of Sayadaw's retreats even have participants going mindfully about their business during the day in their own homes or workplaces and discussing their eperiences and discoveries in evening and weekend Q&A sessions."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_742 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_743,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_744 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "0e74cbbdda6afa3c3f00ab9c9029ad89"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 22 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "Where I could not previously think without the cloud and background of anxious fears and doubts, I now began to be able to consider things more rationally and logically."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_745 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_746 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "84ad39a3293ec3dfad3aad102bbc0f6c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 22 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "And one day I had a moment of clarity."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_747 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_131,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_693 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d3925042e95ba304b0251f6262f70a79"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 22 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "In a moment of balance in mindfulness I saw clearly that when there is mindfulness the mind is totally free of its suffering."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_748 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_385,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_693 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f2fd69e0300a8d76192b9f61d49b85ed"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 22 ;
    neo:sentence_number 5 ;
    neo:text "Then the suffering returned, but the insight had been strong."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_749 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_311,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_750 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f02e29b865b3ffa29c994262a149122d"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 22 ;
    neo:sentence_number 6 ;
    neo:text "Although it was just a glimpse, the mind saw this truth unquestionably."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_751 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_752 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "cbd5afaa15ac3c6ec2e2b9364e210f3f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 22 ;
    neo:sentence_number 7 ;
    neo:text "There is a place of utter peace."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_753 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_290,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_311,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_320,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_754,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_755 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ce2778fce024e346e86c3817e2ccb805"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 22 ;
    neo:sentence_number 8 ;
    neo:text "And the conviction that it gave the mind provided me with the motivation to continue practicing with increased vigor."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_756 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_47,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_49,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_757,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_758 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ef0d06a7aac499adab8f5c5082cf4d8b"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 22 ;
    neo:sentence_number 9 ;
    neo:text "I knew now that this was the way out, for sure, so there was a real desire to practice."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_759 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_320,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_47 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f26ce77b3d123c856495342a6b18fa39"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 22 ;
    neo:sentence_number 10 ;
    neo:text "I began to think about practice daily, about how to practice."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_760 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_463,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_739,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_761,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_762 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "89528ffdea8e1fe6df150b92457141b0"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 23 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "After about six months practicing at home, the depression had gradually disappeared and I began to notice that I would notice my reactions whenever I looked at people or when I heard something."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_763 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_47,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_764 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "977d8e6fc57c24d145dd633e4f773e5a"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 23 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "The thoughts and feelings had calmed down enough and the practice had gained enough momentum that I finally had the mental space and interest to use objects outside of the breath or feelings."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_766 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_47,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_767,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_768,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_769,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_770 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3481ac6a1a463813857f1de654b3c9fc"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 23 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "The practice became interesting in and of itself, and I began initially just one at a time to explore the mind's ability to stay anchored, for example on one pair of fingertips touching while sitting in the shop, on myself when drinking coffee or tea during a break, or being aware of seeing while waiting for customers, and so on."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_771 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_338,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_772,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_773,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_774,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_775 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "8cf5d6c622c23f12e981b00f2884ec2e"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 24 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "And these accumulated practices of collecting the mind enabled me to then be more aware of the interactions within my own mind when I was making decisions, counting money or attending to customers."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_776 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_777,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_778 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "d0aa1c892a9420f791a9c675c2a858d1"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 24 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "I could notice when I lost my composure and devise a plan for maintaining it in my next interaction, always using the practice of collecting the mind as the basis for strengthening the mind's composure."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_779 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_320,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_780,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_781,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_782,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_783,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_784,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_785 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "6fe092fb6d482e72b98c4652822b22cc"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 24 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "As these interactions happened daily and routinely, this is how I learned what helped me to maintain the composure of my mind, what helped me to remain aware and maintain continuity--when I needed to pick up attention on one object, mainly when I was no longer interacting with someone else or doing a task and when I needed to be aware in a more fluid way as in when customers approached and I had to attend to them and interact with them."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_78 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_79,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_80 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Dear Reader"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "3d7160e081aab34ee294630595c8fa2f"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "Other retreats have incorporated mindful talking periods during the day."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_786 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_18,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_372,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_787,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_788 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "22a60f9f93a0699285bc3b703d7877cd"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 24 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "The awareness became closer to continuous and insights naturally arose more and more over time."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_789 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_790,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_791 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "ec1cc964ce63e739d975a82158bf1fcd"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 25 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "A year in, I read an article about the ajivatthamaka sila, eight precepts with right livelihood as the eighth precept."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_792 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_793,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_794,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_795,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_796,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_797 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b981ffc88434d6dee170196003bceadf"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 25 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "I was particularly interested in the expansion of the precept on not telling untruths, into four precepts for right speech: refraining from telling lies, slander, harsh speech, and idle chatter."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_798 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_799 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "f6b4a1d9cfcac4bea571ab5d1760b2b9"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 25 ;
    neo:sentence_number 3 ;
    neo:text "I was inspired to try this."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_8 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_9 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "Introduction (ghost chapter)"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h3 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "89095004187b2b7cd4da0d292a1cd53c"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 4 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "Homage to Him, the Blessed One, the Worthy One,"^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_800 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_290,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_338,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_463,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_801,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_802 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "1e34ddf26b9d39d4cece86b5045c9f63"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 25 ;
    neo:sentence_number 4 ;
    neo:text "The depression had already made me quite subdued at the marketplace I worked at, compared to the joker I had been previously, and then practicing continuously made me quieter."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_803 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_804,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_805 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b845848b96600cddf55aa587e6256432"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 26 ;
    neo:sentence_number 1 ;
    neo:text "However, taking on the four right speech precepts left me with hardly anything to say because I now avoided idle chatter."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_806 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_320,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_49,
        ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_807 ;
    neo:h1 "COLLECTING GOLD DUST: Nurturing the Dhamma in Daily Living"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:h2 "A Note from the Teacher"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:id "b591286c5e5f2243c5a3fde6497787fa"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_name "2019_-_Sayadaw-U-Tejaniya-Collecting-Gold-Dust-Web-Book-1_-_local_converter.md"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:jejune_source_slug "collecting-gold-dust"^^xsd:string ;
    neo:paragraph_number 26 ;
    neo:sentence_number 2 ;
    neo:text "If someone came over to gossip about some other stallholder, they no longer found in me someone that sympathized."^^xsd:string .

ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_808 a neo:Document ;
    neo:MENTIONS ex:node_4_40b58d44_1cd7_4a1a_b4b0_c6bd00cc8a48_39,
